{Just after the time control, we reached the above position which looked
hopeless for me, and indeed I briefly considered resignation. However, the
light dawwned on me. I sealed} 41. g4 $1 {and offered a draw on resumption.
Hempson gazed at the position for 50(!) minutes – and accepted.} 1/2-1/2

